  "sourceTitle": "Planning a 96GB Mac Studio around Qwen3.8-Flash-Next UD-Q4_K_XL — my whole plan depends on the n-gram SSD offload landing. Sanity check?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "0c3696216c55579cf26f9ed986090a756d77024f3db63949f9915e5235112475",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
